Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.39,0:00:12.46,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,He's always very neutral with people.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.46,0:00:16.16,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,He compromises to get along with \Nme and my difficult personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.73,0:00:19.53,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,He doesn't have any preconceptions about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.21,0:00:24.24,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,He appreciates all the effort and \Nhard work I try not to let people see.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.18,0:00:28.71,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,He understands what I'm like.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.01,0:00:37.48,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,So I want to get to know him better.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.73,0:00:40.71,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I wish I could understand him, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.27,0:00:43.75,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Asamura Yuta...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:47.83,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm attracted to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.45,0:00:54.49,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,He's the kind of guy who \Npays attention to detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.49,0:00:55.51,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,250)\fax-.7\fs16\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&H324351&\3c&H7EB3C4&\b1\pos(319.22,123.211)\frz336.2}T{\fs12}HE {\fs16}B{\fs12}EEHIVE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.49,0:00:55.51,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,250)\fax-.6\fs10\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\c&H2B6B87&\3c&H7EB3C4&\b1\pos(438.154,105.242)\frz337.5}T{\fs8}AMURA {\fs10}K{\fs8}ANAE
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.49,0:00:56.61,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnComic Sans MS\fax.1\fs12\shad0\3c&HC0C8CC&\c&H696B68&\frz339.6\pos(468.923,54.903)}Just out on August 22!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.55,0:01:01.45,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,It took him no time to find a book\NI'd spent ten minutes searching for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.68,0:01:07.20,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,But then, when he told me she \Nwould've found it even quicker...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.74,0:01:13.88,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I realized how small-minded \NI must be, and it frustrates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.04,0:01:20.32,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,The next day... Isn't that when \Nthe AC in the living room broke?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.52,0:01:26.17,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,That evening, Asamura-kun confronted me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:30.48,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,He asked if Maaya had \Ninvited us to go to the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.98,0:01:34.19,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H8D8A80&\b1\pos(320,285)}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.82,0:01:35.24,Main - Top + Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't even want to \Nremember how I reacted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:40.41,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs14\shad0\bord1\blur4\c&H969172&\b1\pos(320,285)\3c&H0D0C07&}Then you don't need to force yourself to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.98,0:01:39.59,Main - Top + Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I mean, I can't waste my time playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.45,0:01:41.41,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H979999&\b1\pos(320,290)}Aren't you going? To the pool?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.94,0:01:42.11,Main - Top + Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.66,0:01:43.16,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H979999&\b1\pos(320,290)}No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.41,0:01:47.66,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I think I was really at my limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.15,0:01:54.34,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I lashed out at him with \Na dismissive response
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.34,0:01:56.65,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,because I didn't want to \Nhear any more about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.21,0:01:57.63,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(320,270)\fnGeorgia\fs14\an3\shad0\bord0\c&H9B8C75&\b1\pos(593.846,75.231)}I'm going on ahead
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.94,0:02:02.09,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,What I said was so harsh, I can hardly\N believe it came from my own mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.06,0:02:05.06,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs14\an3\shad0\bord0\c&H9B8C75&\b1\pos(611.846,112.564)}I don't\N want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.06,0:02:07.56,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H9694C8&\b1\pos(320,310)}Yeah, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.20,0:02:08.36,Main - Top + Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I sounded like a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.13,0:02:13.53,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,That was such a horrible day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.18,0:02:18.33,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,The worst part was that I knew \NI was having these awful thoughts,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.33,0:02:20.70,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,but I didn't want to be \Nforced to deal with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.51,0:02:26.33,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,She has such long, beautiful hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.09,0:02:32.70,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Even I think it's lovely. \NIt suits Asamura-kun's modest style.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.82,0:02:40.01,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I wonder if he likes girls\N with long, pretty hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.58,0:02:45.21,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,At least my hair is long, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.75,0:02:50.73,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,What in the world am I thinking? Seriously...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.91,0:02:57.03,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,After finishing dinner,\N he brought it up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.30,0:03:00.28,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,He said he wanted me \Nto go have fun at the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.17,0:03:06.49,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Why is he worried about something like that? \NI need to spend my time studying.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.86,0:03:11.13,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I can't afford to go out and play.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.95,0:03:19.67,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Ah, I've seen that look before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.66,0:03:22.41,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,When I was in middle school,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.41,0:03:26.79,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,there was one time when Mom \Nwanted to take me to the beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.82,0:03:30.31,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Considering our financial situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.73,0:03:33.44,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I didn't think we could afford it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.94,0:03:36.82,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs14\an8\shad0\bord0\c&H9DAA9F&\b1\pos(320,35.898)}It's okay. I've got tests coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.05,0:03:38.44,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I didn't want to force Mom \Nto take a day off work.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:47.20,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs14\shad0\an8\bord0\c&HB9D0CE&\b1\pos(320,35.898)}Okay, maybe next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.15,0:03:43.60,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,That's when she made that face. \NA kind of disappointed look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.31,0:03:47.20,Flashback,Taichi,0,0,0,,Sunday, August 6th.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.18,0:03:49.83,Flashback,Taichi,0,0,0,,We're at the beach today.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:53.03,Flashback,Taichi,0,0,0,,Oh, Yuta! Don't run, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.55,0:03:59.62,Flashback,Taichi,0,0,0,,Gosh, what did I just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.60,0:04:02.31,Flashback,Taichi,0,0,0,,Here. Can you stand up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:19.54,Flashback,Young Saki,0,0,0,,Wanna play?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.71,0:04:38.27,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,It feels so warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.43,0:04:42.04,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Even in this cool breeze,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.15,0:04:46.55,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,the inside of me feels nice and warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.07,0:04:52.98,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,And when I take a deep breath \Nand exhale, I feel lighter somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:56.50,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,In both body and mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.83,0:05:00.59,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about it a lot...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.61,0:05:07.39,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,and I guess I could go to the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.96,0:06:45.96,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,610)\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\an3\bord0\c&HA789E8&\b1\pos(604.381,246.701)}Episode 9 {\fs14}"Step{\c&HCDBD7F&}sister {\c&HA789E8&}and Diary"
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.02,0:06:52.38,Flashback,Akiko,0,0,0,,Saki...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.62,0:06:54.86,Flashback,Akiko,0,0,0,,Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.55,0:06:57.72,Flashback,Akiko,0,0,0,,Saki?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.76,0:07:04.72,Flashback,Akiko,0,0,0,,Look. We're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.42,0:07:21.88,Flashback,Young Saki,0,0,0,,They're so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.40,0:07:25.20,Flashback,Young Saki,0,0,0,,They're so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.43,0:07:30.91,Flashback,Akiko,0,0,0,,Are you sure this is the one you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.91,0:07:33.22,Flashback,Young Saki,0,0,0,,Yup! This is the one!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.15,0:07:37.35,Flashback,Young Saki,0,0,0,,Growr!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.48,0:08:06.11,Flashback,Young Saki,0,0,0,,Mommy, look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.47,0:08:10.48,Default,Tomoya,0,0,0,,Asamura, don't you work at a bookstore?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.48,0:08:11.72,Default,girl,0,0,0,,Do you really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.22,0:08:12.46,Default,girl,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.72,0:08:12.46,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.46,0:08:14.65,Default,Keisuke,0,0,0,,Can you make a lot of money at a bookstore?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.65,0:08:15.60,Default,boy,0,0,0,,Well? Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.60,0:08:16.73,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:17.68,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Sounds great!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:19.73,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's the first job I've ever had.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.73,0:08:23.57,Default,Yumi,0,0,0,,But all you've done over break is work\N and study? That's so responsible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.57,0:08:26.03,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Responsible! Mr. Responsible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.03,0:08:27.04,Default,Daisuke,0,0,0,,All I've done is sleep the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.04,0:08:28.01,Default,girl,0,0,0,,For real!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.61,0:08:30.50,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm not that responsible, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.41,0:08:30.50,Default,girl,0,0,0,,I'm the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.50,0:08:32.99,Default,boy,0,0,0,,Aw, don't be modest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.71,0:08:32.99,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,Totally!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.39,0:08:36.15,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Today's the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.86,0:08:42.08,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm not really that good \Nat dealing with friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.47,0:08:45.92,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm always bad at reading the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.19,0:08:51.31,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,But today actually wasn't too painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.04,0:08:54.76,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I think I have Asamura-kun to thank for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:57.76,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,He's a lot better with people than I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.18,0:09:03.12,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,But when he doesn't like \Nsomething, he just says so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.77,0:09:08.20,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I think that's one of the reasons \NI'm attracted to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:10.09,Default,boy,0,0,0,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.62,0:09:46.60,Default,Maaya,0,0,0,,All right, now we're going to play \Nsome kickboard Othello! It's super easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.60,0:09:48.19,Default,all,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.02,0:09:53.27,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Instead of trying to stand out,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.27,0:09:56.47,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,he's always trying to make \Nsure everyone else has fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.76,0:10:00.01,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I thought that was really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:05.75,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Even though it seems like \Nnobody else notices.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.19,0:10:10.72,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm the only one who does.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.93,0:10:17.34,Main - Top + Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't know. That makes \Nme feel kind of proud...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.84,0:10:17.34,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&H7D806C&\b1\pos(320,290)}What you just did...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.34,0:10:22.35,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,1780)\fnGeorgia\fs14\shad0\bord0\c&HAA9D8A&\b1\pos(315,285)}T{\blur1}hat was really cool
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.87,0:10:20.31,Main - Top + Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,and a little scared.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:21.46,0:10:27.72,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I mean, I don't want to become the center\Nof attention and then risk screwing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.72,0:10:29.71,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,It's a team game, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.21,0:10:31.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.52,0:10:36.38,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Well, ignoring the objective \Nreality of the situation,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.38,0:10:39.61,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,subjectively, I wanted \Nto compliment you for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.10,0:10:43.18,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I just thought it was really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.74,0:10:46.31,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Like a stagehand who's devoted \Nto assisting everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.42,0:10:51.13,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Are stagehands really that cool, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.78,0:10:54.38,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Well, everyone's standards are different.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.87,0:10:58.99,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I guess that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.67,0:11:02.54,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,But if you keep talking like that, \NI'm gonna get embarrassed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.69,0:11:11.92,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,No, that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.67,0:11:44.79,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,All right. Maybe I'll go swim a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.41,0:11:58.00,Default,boy,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.00,0:11:58.72,Default,boy,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.72,0:11:59.69,Default,boy,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.41,0:12:01.37,Default,boy,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.75,0:12:17.61,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.41,0:12:39.53,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,I like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.67,0:12:52.65,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,Honestly, I've never been great with girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.63,0:12:56.44,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,Probably because of how my mom and dad were.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.45,0:13:01.28,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,It gave me a really cynical view of \Nrelationships between men and women.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.73,0:13:08.09,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's why I've never fallen in love \Nwith anyone before now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.06,0:13:11.08,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,And yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.25,0:13:17.65,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,This emotion, this feeling that most people \Nregard as so sacred and glorious...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.16,0:13:21.53,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,How did it sneak up on me like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.17,0:13:24.47,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,And why right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:28.22,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,And why, of all people...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.34,0:13:32.14,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,She's my little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.89,0:13:36.18,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,But she's also Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.94,0:13:39.00,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.33,0:13:41.74,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,little stepsister.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.69,0:13:47.05,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You and Maaya have sure gotten friendly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.05,0:13:52.56,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, yeah, I wanted to \Nthank her for the invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.21,0:13:57.66,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,She really took care of everything. \NI had a great time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.34,0:14:00.50,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Narasaka-san is pretty incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.13,0:14:02.19,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.76,0:14:03.91,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.91,0:14:07.54,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,She's my friend. I'm happy to hear \Nthat people appreciate her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.48,0:14:13.02,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Did you have a good time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.57,0:14:15.20,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.05,0:14:27.02,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Ever since I was a kid, \NI've liked swimming at pools.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.74,0:14:32.02,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I hadn't been able to enjoy swimming \Nfor a while, so this was really fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.79,0:14:37.26,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm really glad I listened to you, Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.18,0:14:44.48,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I mean, I didn't really do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.83,0:14:49.49,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-sa—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.07,0:15:06.60,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That sure startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.69,0:15:10.62,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I did see a lot of people in yukata today.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.11,0:15:26.20,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Asamura-kun, I think you're incredibly \Nthoughtful and considerate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.11,0:15:28.03,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.65,0:15:30.14,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I really admire that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.25,0:15:36.22,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.94,0:15:39.64,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah, I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.06,0:15:44.00,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I realized this was my chance to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.59,0:15:46.75,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You see how hard people try.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.35,0:15:53.21,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I know I said this at the pool, \Nbut I think that part of you is really cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.94,0:16:00.26,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,He shines so brightly in my life. \NHe looks so cool to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.30,0:16:02.99,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I think you're great...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:05.06,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,Which is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.87,0:16:10.99,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.94,0:16:21.02,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Um, sorry. Did I surprise you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:26.79,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You're always taking care of me \Nand going out of your way for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.48,0:16:31.74,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You're someone I can truly rely on. \NLike a real brother, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.46,0:16:35.39,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I'm glad, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.32,0:16:40.18,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,But it still sounds kind of weird, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.64,0:16:43.73,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.73,0:16:45.10,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.29,0:16:49.48,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,Honestly, that was a close call.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.44,0:16:56.70,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,Her calling me that, as unexpected as it was,\Nbrought me back to my senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.90,0:17:04.33,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,Ayase-san's friendly behavior, her praise... \NIt was all for her brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.27,0:17:08.39,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,She trusts me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.97,0:17:14.72,Main - Italics,Yuta,0,0,0,,Meanwhile, here I was, \Ntrying to break all our rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.90,0:17:26.14,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.55,0:17:30.47,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to act when I get home?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.58,0:17:36.66,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I hope he didn't notice how much \Nmy hands were trembling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:40.40,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I have to keep repeating it to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.27,0:17:44.50,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,The two of you are siblings, girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.07,0:17:48.98,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,But maybe, just maybe...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.82,0:17:56.00,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,If Asamura-kun did like me and \Nchose to share how he felt with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:18:01.08,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,would I be able to fully reject those feelings?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.81,0:18:03.96,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.57,0:18:11.05,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,If he takes even one step forward, \NI just know I would...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.73,0:18:15.51,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I would completely fall apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:21.74,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(640,1190)\fnGeorgia\shad0\bord0\fs16\3c&H444242&\c&HE1D4D2&\pos(132.259,139.835)}Friday, August 28th
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.19,0:18:26.66,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Oh, Mom? What about work?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.66,0:18:28.44,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I took the day off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:31.02,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Is Yuta still in bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.02,0:18:34.80,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,He must be exhausted. Why don't \Nwe let him sleep a little longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.20,0:18:37.37,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Saki-chan, do you have work again today?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.21,0:18:40.61,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I took yesterday and today off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.61,0:18:42.09,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Did Yuta-kun, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.09,0:18:42.72,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.01,0:18:46.10,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Great! Then we can all spend \Nsome time together!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.10,0:18:47.91,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,The whole family!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.24,0:18:50.57,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm glad she's happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.21,0:18:55.45,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I want her to be happy enough \Nto make up for all the hard times.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.97,0:18:59.10,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,So I... Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.99,0:19:03.79,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going to \Nlock away these feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.61,0:19:07.95,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't want to spoil our parents' happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.03,0:19:12.08,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't want to cause trouble for Asamura-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.10,0:19:32.79,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I pray that nobody finds out how I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.59,0:19:43.43,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Saki told us that you have \Nthe day off from work.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.11,0:19:44.99,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.99,0:19:48.20,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,And at this point, you're a \Nconfirmed cram school skipper, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.37,0:19:53.42,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You mean you knew about that \Nand still didn't wake me up?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.01,0:19:56.58,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,This sort of thing is good \Nfor you once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.63,0:20:01.87,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Thank you, Yuta-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.87,0:20:02.59,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.46,0:20:06.11,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,For taking Saki to the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.07,0:20:08.50,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:12.81,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Actually, it was Ayase-san's \Nfriend who invited us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.74,0:20:20.82,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,But if you hadn't dragged her along,\Nthat girl probably wouldn't have gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.05,0:20:26.55,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,You might be right about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.87,0:20:31.58,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,I'm so glad you're her older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.93,0:20:38.17,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right, Yuta-kun! \NSaki's favorite thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.17,0:20:40.61,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Oh, what you mentioned before?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.61,0:20:43.09,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'll show you what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.09,0:20:43.87,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.39,0:20:48.22,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Huh? This is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.22,0:20:49.49,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.49,0:20:53.07,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,Welcome home! Ooh, that's new!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.80,0:20:55.34,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Welcome ho—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.34,0:20:58.36,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Whoa, you look totally different!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.36,0:20:59.74,Default,Akiko,0,0,0,,It looks great on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.74,0:21:00.86,Default,Taichi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.45,0:21:06.86,Default,Yuta,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Ayase-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.39,0:21:13.42,Default,Saki,0,0,0,,Thank you, Big Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.65,0:21:25.71,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I pulled my diary out and \Nreread what I'd written so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.95,0:21:32.78,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I realized that I'd been much more blunt \Nand honest in my diary than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.44,0:21:39.82,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,All of my thoughts about growing \Nmore and more attracted to him
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.82,0:21:41.87,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,were spelled out right there on the page.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.72,0:22:20.64,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,But my diary entries for this week \Nwill only exist in my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.25,0:22:23.49,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,If I leave a written record,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.49,0:22:26.57,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,there's always a chance that \Nhe may find it someday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.82,0:22:58.71,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm never going to write down \Nhow I truly feel ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.17,0:23:04.88,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,When I want to relive my memories, \NI'll do it inside my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.10,0:23:11.99,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I shouldn't spend my days trying to \Nconnect with him as just some girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.61,0:23:17.68,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I'm only his little sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.15,0:23:21.51,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I have to live with him as his stepsister.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.21,0:23:25.10,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,And in my life as his stepsister,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.52,0:23:28.51,Main - Italics,Saki,0,0,0,,I don't need a diary anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.48,0:23:49.99,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnGeorgia\fs10\shad0\bord0\c&H8D7FE5&\b1\pos(320,162.606)}Episode 10 {\fs14}"Relations and {\c&H89CAEB&}Re{\c&H8D7FE5&}grets"
